229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 161 0 R
/T (The EventForce Management System is a centralized Salesforce solution for running event- planning operations: client bookings, event scheduling, venue reservations, vendor coordination, cancellation approvals, reminders, and feedback collection. Event teams work with Events, Clients, Vendors, Venues, and Feedback records that are connected through a structured data model. Flows send event reminders and update process status, while an Approval Process controls cancellation requests. Apex classes and triggers handle venue availability and block double bookings. A Lightning App, reports, and a dashboard give the team a live view of schedules, vendor activity, and operational performance. Together these features improve booking coordination, data accuracy, communication, and the client experience. )
/E (The EventForce Management System is a centralized Salesforce solution for running event- planning operations: client bookings, event scheduling, venue reservations, vendor coordination, cancellation approvals, reminders, and feedback collection. Event teams work with Events, Clients, Vendors, Venues, and Feedback records that are connected through a structured data model. Flows send event reminders and update process status, while an Approval Process controls cancellation requests. Apex classes and triggers handle venue availability and block double bookings. A Lightning App, reports, and a dashboard give the team a live view of schedules, vendor activity, and operational performance. Together these features improve booking coordination, data accuracy, communication, and the client experience. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
