/Title (Building the project taught the full implementation cycle: designing a data model, writing validation rules, flows, and Apex, securing data with profiles, roles, permission sets, and sharing rules, migrating data, testing, and documenting the result. Although the solution was built and tested in a Developer Edition org without a production deployment, it follows real- world Salesforce practice and provides a base for future growth.)
