2271 0 obj
<<
/Title (The EventForce Management System is a centralized Salesforce solution for running event- planning operations: client bookings, event scheduling, venue reservations, vendor coordination, cancellation approvals, reminders, and feedback collection. Event teams work with Events, Clients, Vendors, Venues, and Feedback records that are connected through a structured data model. Flows send event reminders and update process status, while an Approval Process controls cancellation requests. Apex classes and triggers handle venue availability and block double bookings. A Lightning App, reports, and a dashboard give the team a live view of schedules, vendor activity, and operational performance. Together these features improve booking coordination, data accuracy, communication, and the client experience.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2252 0 R
>>
endobj
