<<
/Title (EventForce is a Salesforce CRM application built for Event Planner Solutions, a business that previously tracked events, clients, venues, and vendors in separate places. The application brings all of this into one platform. It models the business with six custom objects \(Event, Client, Vendor, Venue, Feedback, and the EventVendor junction object\) and automates the routine work with validation rules, formula fields, record-triggered flows, an approval process, Apex triggers and classes, and a nightly batch job.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2272 0 R
/Next 2290 0 R
>>
endobj
2290 0 obj
<<
/Title (Users reach everything through a custom Lightning App named Event Planner. Access is controlled by profiles, roles, a permission set, organization-wide defaults, and sharing rules, so each group of users sees only what it needs. The whole solution was configured and tested in a Salesforce Developer Edition org for academic purposes, following the practices of a real implementation.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2272 0 R
/Prev 2289 0 R
>>
